load @term/seed/code/structure/set
  find set

# An edge: a connection between two vertices, the link of a graph, the one-dimensional cell of a polytope. The 24-cell
# has ninety-six edges, and the mesh is a graph whose edges join neighboring cells, the lines the substrate's rule sends
# tones along. The form carries the set of vertices the edge joins.
form edge
  link vertices, like set
